"""
Tutorial 4 — Discrete (sampled-data) closed-loop LQG.

Sampled version of `LQGDemo` (03): the continuous LQG controller is replaced by the
clocked `DiscreteStateSpace`, fed the ZOH-discretized matrices from the applied
`discrete_controller.toml` asset (designed by `TutorialDiscreteLQG` at
Ts = ControllerTs). Trim is folded into the controller output operating point `y0`,
also carried by that asset, so `controller.y` is the absolute control command — no
external feedforward.

Signal flow (all vector ports):
  ref - measurement --> err (12 ch)
  err --> sample (100 Hz) --> controller       continuous -> clocked (12 ch)
  controller --> zoh --> f16plant.u_in         clocked -> continuous (5 ch)

The 100 Hz clock is planted on `controller.u` and propagated to the samplers and
holds by clock inference.

Scenario: 10 deg initial pitch perturbation about trim.
"""
component DiscreteClosedLoopDemo
  "Vector-I/O F16 plant; 10 deg initial pitch perturbation about trim."
  # Trim operating point, then a 10 deg pitch perturbation: modifications resolve
  # left-to-right, so the named theta_init after the clause overrides the file value.
  f16plant = F16ModelWorkshop.Plant.F16PlantModel(apply "dyad://F16ModelWorkshop/trim_point.toml", theta_init = 0.17453292519943295) {^f16plant}
  "Discrete (ZOH) LQG controller as a clocked state-space block; trim folded into the output operating point y0."
  controller = DiscreteComponents.DiscreteStateSpace(nx = 12, nu = 12, ny = 5, apply "dyad://F16ModelWorkshop/discrete_controller.toml") {^controller}
  "Controller sample clock (100 Hz), vector: one clock per controller input."
  clk = F16ModelWorkshop.VectorBlocks.VectorClock(n = 12, dt = ControllerTs) {^clk}
  "Reference set-points for the 12 measured states (vector source)."
  ref = F16ModelWorkshop.VectorBlocks.VectorConstant(n = 12, apply "dyad://F16ModelWorkshop/trim_reference.toml") {^ref}
  "Tracking error block: error = ref - measurement (12 ch)."
  err = F16ModelWorkshop.VectorBlocks.VectorAdd(n = 12, k1 = 1, k2 = -1) {^err}
  "Vector sampler bridging continuous error -> clocked controller input (12 ch)."
  sample = F16ModelWorkshop.VectorBlocks.MultiSampler(n = 12) {^sample}
  "Vector zero-order hold bridging clocked controller output -> continuous control (5 ch)."
  zoh = F16ModelWorkshop.VectorBlocks.MultiZeroOrderHold(n = 5) {^zoh}
relations
  connect(ref.y, err.u1) {^id8}
  connect(f16plant.y_out, err.u2) {^id9}
  connect(err.y, sample.u) {^id10}
  connect(sample.y, controller.u) {^id11}
  connect(controller.y, zoh.u) {^id12}
  connect(zoh.y, f16plant.u_in) {^id13}
  connect(clk.y, controller.u) {^id14}
metadata {
  "_links": {
    "f16plant": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": 280, "y1": 146, "x2": 380, "y2": 246, "rot": 0}
        },
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    "controller": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": 360, "y1": 370, "x2": 260, "y2": 470, "rot": 0}
        },
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    "clk": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": 510, "y1": 500, "x2": 610, "y2": 600, "rot": 0}
        },
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    "ref": {
      "Dyad": {
